flowchart TB
  ENG([IT engineer / operator]) -->|console, CLI, ChatOps| NEXUS[NEXUS OMNIS control plane]
  NEXUS -->|rules, verification| FW[pfSense firewall]
  NEXUS -->|switchport VLANs| SW[Core switch]
