  PROM[Prometheus + Alertmanager] -->|webhook alerts| NEXUS
  NEXUS -->|/metrics| PROM
  NEXUS -->|notifications| CHAT[Discord / Slack]
  GIT[(Git: policies, baselines)] -->|desired state| NEXUS
